                                                                                                     ╭─ debit ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
                                                                                                     │ One of the two sides of every bookkeeping entry, written on  │
                                                                                                     │ the left. A debit makes an asset or an expense bigger, and   │
                                                                                                     │ makes a liability, equity or income smaller. Every entry's   │
                                                                                                     │ debits add up to exactly its credits.                        │
                                                                                                     │                                                              │
